---
title: Fluffy Hot Biscuits
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Bread of Life
cook time: 12 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@flour{2%cups}
@baking powder{3%tsp}
@salt{0.75%tsp}
@shortening{5%Tbsp}
@milk{2/3%cup}

Sift flour, baking powder, salt. Cut in shortening. Add milk and mix to a soft dough. Knead lightly for 20 seconds. Roll to 1/2 inch thick. Cut biscuits and bake in very hot oven (450 degrees) for 12 minutes. Makes 12.
